WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.125
List every outcome, then share out the chance.

2
00:00:03.953 --> 00:00:08.528
The sample space lists every possible outcome: red, blue, green.

3
00:00:09.156 --> 00:00:12.881
They are not equally likely. Red is half the spinner: a half.

4
00:00:13.885 --> 00:00:17.360
Blue and green are a quarter each. Together they make one.
